@startuml
title Video Suggestion System

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Receiving Request" as ReceivingRequest
state "Identifying User" as IdentifyingUser
state "Gathering Videos" as GatheringVideos
state "Adding Details" as AddingDetails
state "Sending Suggestions" as SendingSuggestions

Idle --> ReceivingRequest : Video Suggestion Request Received

ReceivingRequest --> IdentifyingUser : Identify User Who Made Request

IdentifyingUser --> GatheringVideos : Gather Videos Based on User Profile or Preferences
GatheringVideos --> GatheringVideos : Gather Trending Videos from User's Area
GatheringVideos --> GatheringVideos : Gather Videos with Similar Tags
GatheringVideos --> GatheringVideos : Gather Videos from Similar Genres
GatheringVideos --> GatheringVideos : Gather Promoted Videos

GatheringVideos --> AddingDetails : Add Thumbnails and View Counts to Suggested Videos

AddingDetails --> SendingSuggestions : Send Suggested Videos to User

SendingSuggestions --> Idle : Video Suggestions Sent Successfully

@enduml
